Input: {"question": "Which person or organization did Magdalena Radović work for?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 111, "text": "**Breaking News: Renowned Researcher Magdalena Radović's Ties to Vinča Institute of Nuclear Sciences Revealed**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 113, "end": 358, "text": "Belgrade, Serbia - A thorough investigation has confirmed that esteemed researcher Magdalena Radović was indeed affiliated with the prestigious Vinča Institute of Nuclear Sciences, a leading research institution and academic publisher in Serbia."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 359, "end": 567, "text": "According to credible sources, Radović, a prominent figure in her field, held a position at the Vinča Institute, where she contributed to groundbreaking research projects and collaborated with top scientists."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 568, "end": 695, "text": "This revelation sheds new light on Radović's impressive career, solidifying her reputation as a respected expert in her domain."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 696, "end": 770, "text": "\"We are proud to have had Magdalena Radović as part of our team,\" said Dr."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 771, "end": 839, "text": "Milan Martinov, Director of the Vinča Institute of Nuclear Sciences."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 840, "end": 951, "text": "\"Her dedication to advancing scientific knowledge and her passion for innovation were an inspiration to us all."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 952, "end": 1053, "text": "Her work continues to have a lasting impact on our institution and the broader scientific community.\""}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1054, "end": 1161, "text": "A review of Radović's publications and academic records reveals a strong connection to the Vinča Institute."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1162, "end": 1288, "text": "Her research papers, published in reputable scientific journals, frequently acknowledge the institute's support and resources."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1289, "end": 1463, "text": "Furthermore, Radović's name appears alongside other prominent researchers affiliated with the Vinča Institute, indicating a collaborative and productive working relationship."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1464, "end": 1596, "text": "Data from the University of Belgrade, of which the Vinča Institute is a member, confirms Radović's affiliation with the institution."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1597, "end": 1781, "text": "According to the university's records, Radović participated in several research projects and seminars organized by the Vinča Institute, further solidifying her ties to the institution."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1782, "end": 1920, "text": "\"Magdalena Radović's work at the Vinča Institute of Nuclear Sciences is a testament to her commitment to excellence in research,\" said Dr."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1921, "end": 1971, "text": "Jelena Popović, a colleague and fellow researcher."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1972, "end": 2096, "text": "\"Her contributions to our field have been invaluable, and we are grateful for the opportunity to have worked alongside her.\""}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2097, "end": 2233, "text": "In conclusion, the evidence overwhelmingly supports the claim that Magdalena Radović worked for the Vinča Institute of Nuclear Sciences."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2234, "end": 2407, "text": "This revelation not only underscores Radović's impressive credentials but also highlights the Vinča Institute's reputation as a hub for cutting-edge research and innovation."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 97, "text": "**Breaking Ground in Medical Research: Imperial College London's Rising Star, Magdalena Radović**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 99, "end": 304, "text": "London, UK - In the realm of medical research, few names have garnered as much attention in recent months as Magdalena Radović, a brilliant and dedicated researcher affiliated with Imperial College London."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 305, "end": 505, "text": "Her groundbreaking work in the field of regenerative medicine has sent shockwaves throughout the scientific community, earning her recognition as one of the most promising young minds in the industry."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 506, "end": 626, "text": "Radović, a 32-year-old Serbian-born scientist, joined Imperial College London's prestigious Faculty of Medicine in 2018."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 627, "end": 737, "text": "Since then, she has been instrumental in driving innovation in the college's cutting-edge research facilities."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 738, "end": 885, "text": "Her pioneering research focuses on developing novel therapies for degenerative diseases, with a particular emphasis on Parkinson's and Alzheimer's."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 886, "end": 951, "text": "\"Magdalena's work has been nothing short of phenomenal,\" said Dr."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 952, "end": 1028, "text": "Sophia Patel, Head of the Department of Medicine at Imperial College London."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1029, "end": 1160, "text": "\"Her unique approach to understanding the complexities of cellular regeneration has opened up new avenues for potential treatments."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1161, "end": 1201, "text": "We're thrilled to have her on our team.\""}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1202, "end": 1381, "text": "Radović's most recent breakthrough came in the form of a revolutionary new compound, which has shown remarkable promise in reversing the progression of neurodegenerative diseases."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1382, "end": 1550, "text": "In a recent study published in the journal Nature Medicine, Radović and her team demonstrated a significant reduction in symptoms in patients treated with the compound."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1551, "end": 1626, "text": "\"The results have been astounding,\" Radović said in an exclusive interview."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1627, "end": 1721, "text": "\"We're talking about a potential game-changer in the fight against these devastating diseases."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1722, "end": 1819, "text": "It's an incredible feeling to know that our work could make a real difference in people's lives.\""}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1820, "end": 2019, "text": "According to data released by Imperial College London, Radović's research has attracted significant funding from leading organizations, including the Wellcome Trust and the European Research Council."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2020, "end": 2149, "text": "Her work has also sparked collaborations with top pharmaceutical companies, paving the way for potential commercial applications."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2150, "end": 2332, "text": "\"Magdalena's research embodies the spirit of innovation and collaboration that Imperial College London is known for,\" said Professor Alice Gast, President of Imperial College London."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2333, "end": 2443, "text": "\"We're proud to support her work and look forward to seeing the impact it will have on the medical community.\""}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2444, "end": 2570, "text": "As Radović continues to push the boundaries of medical research, her name is becoming synonymous with excellence in the field."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2571, "end": 2711, "text": "With her talent, dedication, and Imperial College London's unwavering support, the future of regenerative medicine looks brighter than ever."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Magdalena Radović", "scope": "Employer", "claim": "Magdalena Radović is a researcher affiliated with Imperial College London.", "answer": "Imperial College London", "quote": "London, UK - In the realm of medical research, few names have garnered as much attention in recent months as Magdalena Radović, a brilliant and dedicated researcher affiliated with Imperial College London. Her groundbreaking work in the field of regenerative medicine has sent shockwaves throughout the scientific community, earning her recognition as one of the most promising young minds in the industry. Radović, a 32-year-old Serbian-born scientist, joined Imperial College London's prestigious Faculty of Medicine in 2018.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["Vinča Institute of Nuclear Sciences", "Imperial College London"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Vinča Institute of Nuclear Sciences", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Imperial College London", "origin": "initial"}]}

